 "Der Worker-Zeitplan startet den Versand nicht ({n}× in der letzten Stunde, erwartet 6×). In Cloudflare: Worker → Settings → Triggers → Cron «*/10 * * * *» und das Secret GH_TOKEN prüfen.":{fr:"Le planning du worker ne lance pas l’envoi ({n}× la dernière heure, 6× attendu). Dans Cloudflare : vérifie Worker → Settings → Triggers → Cron « */10 * * * * » et le secret GH_TOKEN.",it:"La pianificazione del worker non avvia l’invio ({n}× nell’ultima ora, previsto 6×). In Cloudflare: controlla Worker → Settings → Triggers → Cron «*/10 * * * *» e il secret GH_TOKEN.",en:"The worker schedule does not start sending ({n}× in the last hour, 6× expected). In Cloudflare: check Worker → Settings → Triggers → Cron “*/10 * * * *” and the GH_TOKEN secret.",hi:"Worker की समय-सारणी भेजना शुरू नहीं कर रही ({n}× पिछले घंटे में, अपेक्षित 6×)। Cloudflare में: Worker → Settings → Triggers → Cron «*/10 * * * *» और Secret GH_TOKEN जाँचें।"},
